        <details>
            <language>
                <terminology_id>
                    <value>ISO_639-1</value>
                </terminology_id>
                <code_string>de</code_string>
            </language>
            <purpose>Not Specified</purpose>
            <keywords>Medication order, Schema, Medikamentenverordnung, Verordnung, Morgens, Mittags, Abends, Nachts, 1-1-1-1</keywords>
            <use>This template covers the use case medication order, where a user can only specify the timing schema 1-1-1-1 and respective variations, specify the name of the medication, the administration method and route of administration. </use>
            <misuse>This template does not cover the use case, where the user wants to specify a different timing schema such as periodically, weekdays, events and so forth.</misuse>
        </details>
